Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:09.40,Default,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Man, patrol duty sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:13.05,Default,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Yeah. And it's not like anyone's \Ngonna cause trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.61,Default,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,this close to the demon king.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:20.37,Default,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,If anyone's that stupid, I could take\N'em down with just a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.26,Default,SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!\N This is the demon king's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:51.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:27.00,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Monsters of Terror Look Too Ugly!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:27.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE MONSTERS OF TERROR LOOK TOO UGLY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:29.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux went into the forest all alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:32.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,B-But that's dangerous! \NWe must bring her back at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:36.57,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's not unusual for her \Nto go on walks by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.88,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Why are you so panicked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:42.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There was a report from my \Nsubordinates who were on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:47.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Monsters of Terror, Gauche \Nand Urun, have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:50.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What? But they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.92,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. There were once ancient \Nmonsters called "gorgons"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,who petrified those\Nwho looked into their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are descendants of gorgons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:01.03,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Those who look into their \Neyes freeze in fear
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:04.03,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and become unable to move \Nas though they were petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:06.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And they're in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:07.38,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty! Lady Doux! \NI'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:14.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:17.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hmm... Doux's not scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.39,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Look at this, Little Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.23,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,This little shrimp's so petrified \Nshe can't even speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:38.73,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LITTLE BROTHER GAUCHE\NBIG BROTHER URUN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:38.73,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Looks like we're on a roll, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:41.74,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! It don't matter \Nif they're demons or humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:47.24,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,There ain't nobody who's not \Nterrified of how ugly we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:52.37,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,But it ain't no fun if they're just quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:56.58,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,If you're gonna be scared, at least\N be a bit more dramatic about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:04.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! How do you do \Nthat thing you did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to be scary, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.90,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Th-Th-This little shrimp's \Ngot a few screws loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.13,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,She's happy about being scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.89,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,L-Let's get outta here, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:14.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.61,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.61,top,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:21.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to be scary, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.18,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:32.70,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,What a cute little creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.37,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Big Bro's been brainwashed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.94,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Look, Little Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.74,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,This little shrimp's taken a liking \Nto us even though we're ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You've got lots of eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.71,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Y-You're not gonna fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:49.01,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You can't fool me like my Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.72,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,C-C-C-C-Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:54.36,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:00.46,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:04.97,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"THE FRIENDSHIP WALTZ"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: TAKERU TAKEMIYA\NSONG: DOUX, URUN, GAUCHE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.93,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Scary, scary
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:15.39,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,So fun, so fun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:19.27,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Doux's name is Doux
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:19.86,overlap italics,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:23.61,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:24.66,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:29.16,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Runtatta, runtatta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:33.04,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The friendship waltz
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:37.04,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Runtatta, runtatta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:40.79,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The friendship waltz
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:44.80,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's play together forever and ever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:48.82,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The friendship waltz
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Lookee, lookee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:02.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:06.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:10.09,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hup... I'll get you some water!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:12.75,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Doux has so much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:17.10,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,They do say that a child has endless \Nenergy when they're playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:23.86,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,When was the last time\N we played with someone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:28.24,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind playing with Doux forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:35.74,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,But we'd probably cause her trouble \Nif we were with her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:37.22,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.73,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Not to mention, once she grows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:44.50,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,she'll see how ugly we \Nare and be scared of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:48.06,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,It's best that we're just alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:52.09,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Because of that... we should \Nprobably bow out now, Little Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:57.64,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,You're right. More importantly, \Nwhat's Doux doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:02.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is practicing scary faces! Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:06.56,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You mentioned that \Nyou wanted to be scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:08.40,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna be scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:13.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to be a full-fledged demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:19.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I'm not really good at doing bad \Nthings, so Big Sister Jahi said...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:25.67,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,No matter what trials I give her, \Nthere's been no change in Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:31.55,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,If she'd at least try \Nto look or act scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.65,flashback,JAHI,0,0,0,,she might actually change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So I've been trying to make my face scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:42.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But Doux isn't very good at that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:49.50,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Everyone's got something they can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.20,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,I've got tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:54.70,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Just keep practicing so that \Nyou'll be able to pull it off someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:58.37,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Then who knows? \NMaybe it'll actually happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:01.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:05.39,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Who would've thought a little kid \Nwould be so worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:06.46,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Right, Little Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:10.21,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,I'm actually really \Nworried right now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.72,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,What?! Little Bro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.97,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,I realized something when \Nwe were playing with Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:18.86,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,It's been fun being with \Njust you, Big Bro,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.59,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,but it's even more fun with \Nthe three of us together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:29.48,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,So that means it'd be even more \Nfun if we were with even more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:31.95,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Gauche, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:34.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay. Then let's go play with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:40.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,There's lots of humans and \Ndemons who live in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:45.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If we all play together,\Nit'll be even more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:48.19,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,W-We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.36,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Everyone'll just be scared of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:54.63,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Because we're so hard to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:57.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You're easy to look at though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:58.71,Default,BOTH,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:03.14,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well, look how big you are, \NBig Brother Gauche!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:06.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You'd be easy to find\Nif we played hide-and-seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:07.73,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:08.96,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:10.97,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Hard to look at...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.88,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HARD TO LOOK AT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.92,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HARD TO SEE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:14.53,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,EASY TO SEE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.53,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Easy to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:19.46,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,True. There ain't anyone \Neasier to see than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.79,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,You got us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.63,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,B-Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.33,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Let's just go, Little Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.17,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Don't worry. If we scare 'em, \Nwe'll worry about it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:31.00,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Your big bro's got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.92,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Big Bro... Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.80,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Yeah... you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:43.06,Default,SLAVES,0,0,0,,Save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.06,0:09:45.68,Default,GUARDS,0,0,0,,So scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.19,Default,KIDS,0,0,0,,Mr. Urun! Mr. Gauche!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We got to be scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:10:01.73,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Yup, yup. You guys were pretty scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:02.70,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Right, Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.71,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Okay, how about... {\i1}this{\i0} next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.21,Default,KIDS,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:13.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Like this, Mr. Urun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.67,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Yeah. Very good, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.01,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:23.87,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.56,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Look, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Not only was she not in any danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:35.23,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but she even befriended \Nthe Monsters of Terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:41.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Perhaps Lady Doux is already \Namazing just as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thunder, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:56.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thunder... Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.97,flashback,SOLDIER C,0,0,0,,Did you hear that on stormy nights \Nwith thunder and lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.46,flashback,SOLDIER C,0,0,0,,a wailing ghost appears?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.71,flashback,SOLDIER D,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.31,flashback,SOLDIER D,0,0,0,,We've already got Monsters of Terror. \NWhy'd something like that appear, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:13.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hmph. How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:21.57,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Something's definitely wailing, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:24.58,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,C-C-Calm down. Who's scared of any ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.00,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'll make them regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:31.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:31.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux. Is the thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:45.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Goodness. What a fussy little ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:52.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're completely fine with the Monsters \Nof Terror but scared of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:58.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess you really are still just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:09.49,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE SPIRIT TOWER IS JUST TOO EXCITING!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:09.49,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Spirit Tower Is Just Too Exciting!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:14.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So, Jahi, how are Doux's trials going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Because I'm so inadequate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:22.38,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,When you're stuck, \Nthere's always another path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:27.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi, I hereby give you a new mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:28.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A new mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:33.05,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is a very important mission \Nthat I cannot trust to any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:39.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This will be beneficial as you \Ncontinue to give Doux her trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:42.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You honor me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:47.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I, Jahi, will see this mission through \Neven at the cost of my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! I put this on all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:54.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well done, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:56.97,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Look. If you just fix \Nthis part, it's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.17,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:01.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It looks wonderful on... wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:03.46,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I came here because you said \Nthis mission was important,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:05.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,but this is just a vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:08.80,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Don't be so naïve, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:11.69,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is the Spirit Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:13.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Spirit Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:14.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:21.14,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's a giant ryokan that lies in the \Nmiddle of dimensions where not only demons
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:24.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but beings from various\N worlds come to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Other worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:32.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is there any danger like the pishacha \Nthat once controlled Salamandra?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:33.67,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Quarrels at the Spirit \NTower are forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:41.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Meaning this is the perfect place to \Nfind out more about all of the people
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:43.93,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,we will eventually conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:48.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I see. So our true motive\N is reconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.85,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, very good, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:57.85,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let's see, here. Papa will join in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:03.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, how fun this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:08.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! Everyone's watching real hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:09.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.77,0:14:14.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Today, we will act as a visiting\Nfamily and have tons of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tons of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:19.38,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Er, Jahi? Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:20.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.88,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This family is hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:27.07,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,No... I need to pull myself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:30.01,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,First, I will investigate the \Npatrons from the demon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.90,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dance with us, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.27,Default,KAPPA,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:38.66,Default,ITTANMOMEN,0,0,0,,Is something fun going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.02,Default,TENGU,0,0,0,,I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:45.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty! Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:48.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Take care of Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:52.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Understood! Lady Doux! \NI'm heading to you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:55.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:56.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:09.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa and Big Sister Jahi are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.18,Default,PATRON D,0,0,0,,What do they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:14.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You dropped this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:17.18,top,PATRON D,0,0,0,,Missy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.56,Default,PATRON E,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:22.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.59,Default,PATRON E,0,0,0,,Now, I've gotta thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:26.69,Default,PATRON E,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:30.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's see... Papa and Big Sister Jahi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:34.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! He's all shaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:34.97,top,PATRON E,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait! I still haven't thanked you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:37.53,Default,EMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,You're a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:38.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:43.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pain, pain, fly away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.71,Default,OLD PATRON,0,0,0,,My bad back's better in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:49.02,Default,OLD PATRON,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.23,Default,CHILD A,0,0,0,,Mom, I wanna eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:52.41,Default,CHILD B,0,0,0,,I need to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:58.33,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! How long is my husband\Ngoing to take in the bathroom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:00.23,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:12.49,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Oh my. Look at you, in a good \Nmood because Doux played with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.12,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.66,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,You really helped me out. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:23.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:34.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:39.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:41.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:44.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And you've been doing \Nkind things everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:47.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll never be \Na full-fledged demon... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:51.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:56.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um... a lot of people showed up, \Nand then you and Papa were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:17:00.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I kept wanting to \Nask people where you went,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:02.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,but they were all in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:05.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,so I was helping them and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:08.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A-All right. Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:14.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,First of all... I'm just \Nglad you're safe, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's go find His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:26.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Make sure you hold onto my hand \Nthis time so we don't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:27.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:45.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:49.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, I happened to get along \Nwith this group of guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.69,Default,TENGU,0,0,0,,Eat and drink as much as you'd like!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.63,Default,TENGU,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.89,Default,ALL,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.46,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The food here is exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:05.27,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux, let me make your plate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:06.14,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hup, hup, huppity hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay! You're amazing, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:19.26,Default,KAPPA,0,0,0,,Hey there, hottie. Come over \Nhere and have a drink with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:21.17,Default,ITTANMOMEN,0,0,0,,Don't try to get ahead, you pervy kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:23.05,Default,KAPPA,0,0,0,,What?! Who're you callin' bald?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:24.26,Default,ITTANMOMEN,0,0,0,,I never said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:25.82,Default,KAPPA,0,0,0,,You're always callin' me bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:27.91,Default,KAPPA,0,0,0,,I'm not bald! I just \Nhave a plate on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:31.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! You're so good, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is how you do it, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:40.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:42.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. Make sure they don't cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:48.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll share some with you, too, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:54.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:58.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This food is so squishy and fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:00.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I wonder what it tastes like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:21.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The water feels great. \NI'm being warmed up to my core.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:24.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait! We're just enjoying \Nourselves after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.54,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How was it, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.31,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy your bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:36.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:41.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I forgot my mission and acted \Ndisgracefully. I'm so ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:45.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about that!\N That comes second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:46.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:50.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I figured you wouldn't tag \Nalong unless I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:55.99,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Initially, I was planning for this to \Nbe a family trip for just Doux and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:59.67,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but she insisted that \Nyou come along as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:01.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,B-But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:07.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's because you're my \Nbig sister, Big Sister Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:08.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:10.87,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, there you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:14.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You get to also enjoy \Nyourself on our family trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:19.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty... You're becoming \Nmore and more like Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:21.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What?! I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:24.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.99,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ooh. It looks like it's started...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:32.97,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The Spirit Tower's famous \Nfireworks display.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.91,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister, come sit with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.91,0:20:41.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:48.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:54.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Well, it's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.07,0:22:31.53,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Attendant \NThinks Too Much!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:31.53,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S ATTENDANT THINKS TOO MUCH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:38.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I thought about this at the hot springs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:40.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,but having long hair just gets in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:41.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:44.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Ooh, changing up your look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.57,0:22:47.13,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Did you fall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:50.25,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Did you fall for an ogre since \Nyou're a meathead attendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.25,0:22:53.56,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Or maybe a cyclops is more your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:59.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There'd be nothing more shameful than if \Nshe were to accuse me of such non-truths!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:03.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I know! I'll just cut it short!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:09.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's not a proper hairstyle \Nfor my attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:12.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If he says that, I won't \Nbe able to take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.99,0:23:13.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Should I tie up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Or cut it short?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:15.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Tie it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:16.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Cut it short?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.90,0:23:18.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Tie? Short? Tie? Short?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:24.75,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,Tie? Short? Tie? Short?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:21.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Look at that lame hair!
